            <ArticleTitle>History and examination of the orofacial pain patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>155-66</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The clinician should recognize the importance of screening examinations for all patients seen in the dental office. The elements of a brief screening history and examination have been reviewed. In addition, the indications and elements of a comprehensive history and examination have been described. A discussion of current opinion on available diagnostic testing was also presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
